  "prefLabel": "He-P 802.37 Psychiatric Hospital",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 802.37 Psychiatric Hospital.\n\n(a) A psychiatric hospital, as defined in He-P 802.03(ci), shall meet the criteria set forth in He-P 802, including He-P 802.28.\n\n(b) Each psychiatric hospital shall have a full time administrator who meets the qualifications for an administrator as defined in He-P 802.17(b) and shall be responsible to the governing body for the daily management and operation of the hospital which, in addition to those responsibilities defined in He-P 802.17(b), shall include ensuring development and implementation of hospital policies and procedures on:\n\n(1) Voluntary and involuntary emergency admission; and\n\n(2) Seclusion and restraints.\n\n(c) Psychiatric hospitals shall be exempt from He-P 802.17(e) and (f) and He-P 802.32.\n\nSource. #13166, eff 1-28-21 (formerly He-P 802.33); ss by #14081, eff 9-25-24, EXPIRES: 9-25-34 (formerly He-P 802.36)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p800.html"
